iv> </div> </div> </div> </div> </li> </ul> </nav> <div class="header__actions"> <button class="header-search__toggle" type="button" aria-label="Search Services, Solutions, Integrations, and Case Studies" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="elogic-header-search-panel" data-header-search-toggle> <svg viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"> <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle> <path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"></path> </svg> </button> <div class="butt-standard filled"> <a href="https://elogic.co/contacts/" target=""> Contact us </a> </div> </div> </div> <button class="mob-btn mob-btn-menu" role="button" aria-controls="mob-menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open menu"></button> </div> <div class="header-search" id="elogic-header-search-panel" data-header-search-sheet role="search" aria-label="Search Services, Platforms, Industries, Integrations, Case Studies..." hidden> <form class="header-search__inner" action="https://elogic.co/" method="get" data-header-search-root data-header-search-endpoint="https://elogic.co/wp-json/elogic/v1/search-index"> <div class="header-search__bar"> <svg viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"> <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle> <path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"></path> </svg> <label for="elogic-header-search" class="screen-reader-text nitro-lazy">Search Services, Platforms, Industries, Integrations, Case Studies...</label> <input id="elogic-header-search" type="search" name="s" placeholder="Search Services, Platforms, Industries, Integrations, Case Studies..." role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" aria-autocomplete="list" aria-controls="elogic-header-search-results" autocomplete="off" data-header-search-input class="nitro-lazy" /> <span class="header-search__key-help" aria-hidden="true">&uarr;&darr; navigate</span> <span class="header-search__key-help" aria-hidden="true">ESC close</span> <button class="header-search__close" type="button" aria-label="Close search" data-header-search-close>&times;</button> </div> <div class="header-search__body" id="elogic-header-search-results"> <div class="header-search__zero" data-header-search-zero> <div> <p class="header-search__zero-title">Popular searches</p> <div class="header-search__chips"> <button type="button" data-header-search-query="Replatforming">Replatforming</button> <button type="button" data-header-search-query="ERP integration">ERP integration</button> <button type="button" data-header-search-query="Magento 2 migration">Magento 2 migration</button> <button type="button" data-header-search-query="B2B portal">B2B portal</button> <button type="button" data-header-search-query="Rescue a project">Rescue a project</button> <button type="button" data-header-search-query="Hire developers">Hire developers</button> </div> </div> <div> <p class="header-search__zero-title">Quick links</p> <ul> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/b2b-ecommerce-development-and-consulting/">B2B Ecommerce Development</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/replatforming/">Replatforming</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/systems-integration/">Systems Integration</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/projects/">Case Studies</a> </li> </ul> </div> <div> <p class="header-search__zero-title">Tools</p> <ul> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/ecommerce-platform-selector/">Ecommerce Platform Selector</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/adobe-commerce-team-cost-calculator/">Team Cost Calculator</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/adobe-commerce-capacity-gap-assessment/">Capacity Gap Assessment</a> </li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="header-search__matches" data-header-search-matches hidden> <p class="search-results">Search results</p> <div class="header-search__groups" role="listbox" aria-label="Search results"> <div class="header-search__group" data-header-search-group="service" hidden> <p class="header-search__group-label" id="elogic-header-search-group-service">Services</p> <div aria-labelledby="elogic-header-search-group-service" data-header-search-group-items></div> </div> <div class="header-search__group" data-header-search-group="solution" hidden> <p class="header-search__group-label" id="elogic-header-search-group-solution">Solutions</p> <div aria-labelledby="elogic-header-search-group-solution" data-header-search-group-items></div> </div> <div class="header-search__group" data-header-search-group="integration" hidden> <p class="header-search__group-label" id="elogic-header-search-group-integration">Integrations</p> <div aria-labelledby="elogic-header-search-group-integration" data-header-search-group-items></div> </div> <div class="header-search__group" data-header-search-group="project" hidden> <p class="header-search__group-label" id="elogic-header-search-group-project">Case Studies</p> <div aria-labelledby="elogic-header-search-group-project" data-header-search-group-items></div> </div> </div> </div> <aside class="header-search__guidance" data-header-search-guidance hidden> <span>Suggested next step</span> <strong>Not sure which route fits?</strong> <p>A senior architect can map the right service or solution before you commit budget.</p> <a href="https://elogic.co/commerce-architecture-blueprint/" data-search-assessment>Get an Assessment</a> </aside> <div class="header-search__none" data-header-search-none hidden> <strong>No pages match your search yet.</strong> <span>A senior architect can map your case instead:</span> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/">All Services &amp; Platforms</a> <a href="https://elogic.co/solutions/">All Industries</a> <a href="https://elogic.co/integrations/">All Integrations</a> <a href="https://elogic.co/projects/">All Case Studies</a> </div> <p class="screen-reader-text" aria-live="polite" data-header-search-status></p> <div class="header-search__footer"> <span>Evaluating platforms or partners?</span> <a href="https://elogic.co/commerce-architecture-blueprint/" class="header-search__assessment" data-search-assessment>Get an Assessment</a> </div> </div> </form> </div> </header> <div class="overlay-body"></div> <a class="btn_to_top" title="top"></a> <main id="page-home" class="page-home nitro-lazy"> <section class="hero-sec"> <div class="container nitro-lazy"> <div class="hero-sec__heading"> <h1 class="nitro-lazy">Ecommerce Development Company for <span>Complex B2B &amp; B2B2C</span></h1> </div> <div class="hero-sec__content"> <p></p><p style="margin-bottom:16px">Elogic Commerce is a B2B ecommerce development company for complex, ERP-connected B2B and B2B2C systems. We build, replatform, integrate, rescue, and support commerce for manufacturers, distributors, <a href="https://elogic.co/solutions/b2b-wholesale-ecommerce/">wholesalers</a>, and hybrid B2B2C brands.</p> <p>We work across Adobe Commerce, Shopify Plus, BigCommerce, Salesforce Commerce Cloud, SAP Commerce Cloud, and commercetools, with ERP, PIM, CRM, OMS, WMS, PunchOut, and EDI</p> <p></p> </div> <div class="hero-sec__buttons"> <a class="btn_h" href="/contacts/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="Calendly.initPopupWidget({
                                        url: 'https://calendly.com/paul-elogic-commerce/30min'
                                        });
                                        return false;" aria-label="Request a quote for Elogic ecommerce development services"> Schedule a Discovery Call <span class="icon"> <svg width="16" height="10" viewbox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M.985 4.852v1.233h12.849l-2.43 3.187 1.125.712L15.983 5.5l-3.5-4.516-1.125.712 2.43 3.188L.986 4.852z" fill="#fff"></path></svg> </span> </a> <a href="https://elogic.co/commerce-architecture-blueprint/" class="btn_sec" aria-label="Get an Assessment"> Get an Assessment <span class="icon"> <svg width="16" height="10" viewbox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M.985 4.852v1.233h12.849l-2.43 3.187 1.125.712L15.983 5.5l-3.5-4.516-1.125.712 2.43 3.188L.986 4.852z" fill="currentColor"></path> </svg> </span> </a> </div> </div> <div class="hero-sec__number"> <div class="container"> <div class="hero-sec__heading"> <h2>Who we are</h2> </div> <div class="hero-sec__items"> <div class="hero-sec__item" role="group" aria-label="Years in ecommerce: since [elogic_fact key=&quot;founded_year&quot;]"> <h3>17+ <span>years</span></h3> <p>in ecommerce</p> </div> <div class="hero-sec__item" role="group" aria-label="Team size: [elogic_fact key=&quot;engineers_count&quot;]+ ecommerce experts"> <h3 class="nitro-lazy">200<span>+</span></h3> <p>ecommerce specialists</p> </div> <div class="hero-sec__item" role="group" aria-label="Net Promoter Score: [elogic_fact key=&quot;nps&quot;] (post-launch surveys)"> <h3>NPS 70</h3> <p>based on post-launch client surveys</p> </div> <div class="hero-sec__item" role="group" aria-label="[elogic_fact key=&quot;clutch_rating&quot;] Clutch"> <h3>5.0 <span>on Clutch</span></h3> <p>64 verified reviews</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="platforms"> <div class="container"> <div class="flex-row"> <div class="col-3"> <div class="platforms__heading"> <h2 class="nitro-lazy">Ecommerce <span>platforms</span> <br /> we work with</h2> </div> </div> <div class="col-9"> <div class="flex platforms__flex"> <a class="col platforms__col" href="https://elogic.co/services/custom-magento-development-services/" aria-label="Adobe Commerce"> <div class="platforms__logo"> <img width="190" height="50" alt="Adobe Commerce" title="Adobe Commerce" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/Adobe_Corporate_logo-1.svg" class="attachment-full size-full nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MTI1MToyNDg=-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MTI1MToyNDg=-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTkwIDUwIiB3aWR0aD0iMTkwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjUwIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" /> </div> </a> <a class="col platforms__col" href="https://elogic.co/services/shopify-plus-development-company/" aria-label="Shopify"> <div class="platforms__logo"> <img width="177" height="50" alt="Shopify" title="Shopify" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/Shopify_logo_2018-1.svg" class="attachment-full size-full nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MTI1NzoyMzE=-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MTI1NzoyMzE=-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTc3IDUwIiB3aWR0aD0iMTc3IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjUwIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" /> </div> </a> <a class="col platforms__col" href="https://elogic.co/services/salesforce-commerce-cloud-development/" aria-label="Salesforce Commerce Cloud"> <div class="platforms__logo"> <img width="128" height="90" alt="Salesforce" title="Salesforce" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/sales-logo.svg" class="attachment-full size-full nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MTI2MzoyMjg=-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MTI2MzoyMjg=-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTI4IDkwIiB3aWR0aD0iMTI4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjkwIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" /> </div> </a> <a class="col platforms__col" href="https://elogic.co/services/commercetools-development-company/" aria-label="commercetools"> <div class="platforms__logo"> <img width="184" height="37" alt="commercetools" title="commercetools" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/commerce-logo.svg" class="attachment-full size-full nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MTI2OToyMzc=-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MTI2OToyMzc=-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTg0IDM3IiB3aWR0aD0iMTg0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjM3IiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" /> </div> </a> <a class="col platforms__col" href="https://elogic.co/services/bigcommerce-development-services/" aria-label="Bigcommerce"> <div class="platforms__logo"> <img width="188" height="42" alt="bigcommerce" title="bigcommerce" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/bigcommerce-logo.svg" class="attachment-full size-full nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MTI3NToyMzY=-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MTI3NToyMzY=-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTg4IDQyIiB3aWR0aD0iMTg4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQyIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" /> </div> </a> <a class="col platforms__col" href="https://elogic.co/services/sap-commerce-cloud/" aria-label="SAP Commerce Cloud"> <div class="platforms__logo"> <img width="785" height="444" alt="SAP Commerce Cloud" fetchpriority="high" sizes="(max-width: 785px) 100vw, 785px" title="SAP Commerce Cloud" nitro-lazy-srcset="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sap-commerce-cloud.webp 785w, https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sap-commerce-cloud-300x170.webp 300w, https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sap-commerce-cloud-768x434.webp 768w, https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sap-commerce-cloud-325x184.webp 325w" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sap-commerce-cloud.webp" class="attachment-full size-full nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MTI4MTo2NDc=-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MTI4MTo2NDc=-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNzg1IDQ0NCIgd2lkdGg9Ijc4NSIgaGVpZ2h0PSI0NDQiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyI+PC9zdmc+" /> </div> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="text-section"> <div class="container"> <div class="text-wrapper"> <p>We are typically the strongest fit for mid-market and enterprise businesses where platform choice, integrations, and delivery quality have a material business impact. Learn <a href="https://elogic.co/why-elogic-commerce/">why Elogic Commerce is the safe choice for complex B2B and enterprise ecommerce</a> &#8211; from structured discovery and milestone governance to post-launch optimization and support.</p> <p>Deep experience in industrial manufacturing and building materials (<a href="https://elogic.co/projects/armacell/">Armacell</a>), apparel and lifestyle (<a href="https://elogic.co/projects/buff/">Buff</a>), electronics and equipment (<a href="https://elogic.co/projects/hp/">HP</a>), specialty and pet distribution (<a href="https://elogic.co/projects/pethq-b2b-website/">PetHQ</a>), and licensed consumer brands (<a href="https://elogic.co/projects/disney/">Disney</a>).</p> </div> </div> </section> <section class="about"> <div class="container"> <div class="about-header"> <div class="about-header__title"> <h2>Who Elogic Commerce<br /> <span>Is Built For</span></h2> <div class="about-header__text"> <p>Elogic Commerce is a commerce engineering partner for organizations where platform decisions, system integrations, and delivery governance have a material impact on revenue and operations.</p> <p>Founded in 2009, we work exclusively in ecommerce - with deep specialization in complex B2B, B2B2C, and integration-heavy environments, including multi-country global rollouts for international enterprises.</p> </div> </div> <div style="background-image:url(&quot;data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==&quot;)" class="about-header__metric nitro-lazy" nitro-lazy-bg="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/about-image.webp"> <div class="metric"> 17+ <span>Years of Pure Commerce Focus</span> </div> </div> </div> <div class="about-body"> <div class="about-body__block block-1"> <div class="block-header"> <h3>Our Ideal Partnership Profile</h3> <p class="subtitle">Our clients are mid-market and enterprise manufacturers, distributors, wholesalers, and hybrid B2B2C businesses. They come to us when the work is too complex for freelancers, and too focused for global consultancies.</p> </div> <div class="partnership"> <div class="partnership__item"> <span class="icon"> <svg width="14" height="23" viewbox="0 0 14 23" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M0.3125 22.5L0 19.75L3.5625 9.9375C3.875 10.2292 4.21354 10.474 4.57812 10.6719C4.94271 10.8698 5.33333 11.0208 5.75 11.125L2.3125 20.5625L0.3125 22.5ZM13.4375 22.5L11.4375 20.5625L8 11.125C8.41667 11.0208 8.80729 10.8698 9.17188 10.6719C9.53646 10.474 9