25C5.16319 2.48264 5 2.875 5 3.33333ZM1.66667 15V5V15Z" fill="#495E87"></path> </svg> </span> <h4 class="text">CPG &amp; FMCG</h4> </div> <p class="text">FMCG Brands, <br /> Food &amp; Beverage, <br /> Consumer Electronics</p> </div> <div class="specialization__item"> <div class="item-header"> <span class="icon"> <svg width="17" height="15" viewbox="0 0 17 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M8.33333 15L0 5L2.5 0H14.1667L16.6667 5L8.33333 15ZM6.35417 4.16667H10.3125L9.0625 1.66667H7.60417L6.35417 4.16667ZM7.5 11.3958V5.83333H2.875L7.5 11.3958ZM9.16667 11.3958L13.7917 5.83333H9.16667V11.3958ZM12.1667 4.16667H14.375L13.125 1.66667H10.9167L12.1667 4.16667ZM2.29167 4.16667H4.5L5.75 1.66667H3.54167L2.29167 4.16667Z" fill="#495E87"></path> </svg> </span> <h4 class="text">Premium Retail</h4> </div> <p class="text">Jewelry &amp; Luxury, <br /> Fashion Omnichannel</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="about-footer"> <div class="about-footer__block block-map"> <div class="map-header"> <h3>Global Footprint</h3> <p>Headquarters: Tallinn, Estonia. Offices in New York, London, Stockholm, Dresden, and Prague. Delivering across North America and Europe.</p> </div> <div class="locations"> <div class="location"> <h4>North America</h4> <p>New York</p> </div> <div class="location"> <h4>Europe</h4> <p>Tallinn, London, Stockholm, Dresden, Minich, Prague, Amsterdam</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="about-footer__block block-right"> <div class="block-platforms"> <div class="platforms-header"> <h3>Implementation-Led Design</h3> <p>Certified commerce architects and platform engineers handling everything from discovery to post-launch optimization.</p> </div> <ul class="platforms-list"> <li class="platform"> Magento </li> <li class="platform"> BigCommerce </li> <li class="platform"> Shopify Plus </li> <li class="platform"> commercetools </li> </ul> </div> <div class="block-links"> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/ecommerce-discovery-and-planning-services/"> Strategic Discovery <svg width="25" height="24" viewbox="0 0 25 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M14.9311 18.8201C14.7411 18.8201 14.5511 18.7501 14.4011 18.6001C14.1111 18.3101 14.1111 17.8301 14.4011 17.5401L19.9411 12.0001L14.4011 6.46012C14.1111 6.17012 14.1111 5.69012 14.4011 5.40012C14.6911 5.11012 15.1711 5.11012 15.4611 5.40012L21.5311 11.4701C21.8211 11.7601 21.8211 12.2401 21.5311 12.5301L15.4611 18.6001C15.3111 18.7501 15.1211 18.8201 14.9311 18.8201Z" fill="currentColor"></path> <path d="M20.83 12.75H4C3.59 12.75 3.25 12.41 3.25 12C3.25 11.59 3.59 11.25 4 11.25H20.83C21.24 11.25 21.58 11.59 21.58 12C21.58 12.41 21.24 12.75 20.83 12.75Z" fill="currentColor"></path> </svg> </a> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/ui-ux-design-services/"> UX Design &amp; Research <svg width="25" height="24" viewbox="0 0 25 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M14.9311 18.8201C14.7411 18.8201 14.5511 18.7501 14.4011 18.6001C14.1111 18.3101 14.1111 17.8301 14.4011 17.5401L19.9411 12.0001L14.4011 6.46012C14.1111 6.17012 14.1111 5.69012 14.4011 5.40012C14.6911 5.11012 15.1711 5.11012 15.4611 5.40012L21.5311 11.4701C21.8211 11.7601 21.8211 12.2401 21.5311 12.5301L15.4611 18.6001C15.3111 18.7501 15.1211 18.8201 14.9311 18.8201Z" fill="currentColor"></path> <path d="M20.83 12.75H4C3.59 12.75 3.25 12.41 3.25 12C3.25 11.59 3.59 11.25 4 11.25H20.83C21.24 11.25 21.58 11.59 21.58 12C21.58 12.41 21.24 12.75 20.83 12.75Z" fill="currentColor"></path> </svg> </a> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/replatforming/"> Platform Engineering <svg width="25" height="24" viewbox="0 0 25 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M14.9311 18.8201C14.7411 18.8201 14.5511 18.7501 14.4011 18.6001C14.1111 18.3101 14.1111 17.8301 14.4011 17.5401L19.9411 12.0001L14.4011 6.46012C14.1111 6.17012 14.1111 5.69012 14.4011 5.40012C14.6911 5.11012 15.1711 5.11012 15.4611 5.40012L21.5311 11.4701C21.8211 11.7601 21.8211 12.2401 21.5311 12.5301L15.4611 18.6001C15.3111 18.7501 15.1211 18.8201 14.9311 18.8201Z" fill="currentColor"></path> <path d="M20.83 12.75H4C3.59 12.75 3.25 12.41 3.25 12C3.25 11.59 3.59 11.25 4 11.25H20.83C21.24 11.25 21.58 11.59 21.58 12C21.58 12.41 21.24 12.75 20.83 12.75Z" fill="currentColor"></path> </svg> </a> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/systems-integration/"> Systems Integration <svg width="25" height="24" viewbox="0 0 25 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M14.9311 18.8201C14.7411 18.8201 14.5511 18.7501 14.4011 18.6001C14.1111 18.3101 14.1111 17.8301 14.4011 17.5401L19.9411 12.0001L14.4011 6.46012C14.1111 6.17012 14.1111 5.69012 14.4011 5.40012C14.6911 5.11012 15.1711 5.11012 15.4611 5.40012L21.5311 11.4701C21.8211 11.7601 21.8211 12.2401 21.5311 12.5301L15.4611 18.6001C15.3111 18.7501 15.1211 18.8201 14.9311 18.8201Z" fill="currentColor"></path> <path d="M20.83 12.75H4C3.59 12.75 3.25 12.41 3.25 12C3.25 11.59 3.59 11.25 4 11.25H20.83C21.24 11.25 21.58 11.59 21.58 12C21.58 12.41 21.24 12.75 20.83 12.75Z" fill="currentColor"></path> </svg> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="services"> <div class="container"> <div class="services__heading"> <h2>Core Commerce <span>Engineering Services</span> </h2> </div> <div class="flex-row"> <div class="col-3"> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/b2b-customer-portal-development/" target="_self" class="services__block"> <h3>Build a B2B self-service portal</h3> <p>Account-specific pricing, RFQ and quote approvals, purchase orders, net terms and credit limits, PunchOut/EDI, and customer-specific catalogs — synced with your ERP.</p> <div class="services__link"> <svg width="16" height="10" viewbox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M.985 4.852v1.233h12.849l-2.43 3.187 1.125.712L15.983 5.5l-3.5-4.516-1.125.712 2.43 3.188L.986 4.852z" fill="#fff"></path></svg> </div> </a> </div> <div class="col-9"> <div class="flex services__flex"> <div class="col services__col"> <a href="https://elogic.co/solutions/b2b2c-ecommerce/" target="_self" class="services__block"> <h3>Launch or scale B2B2C commerce</h3> <p>Unify wholesale, dealer, and direct-to-consumer journeys on one architecture: shared product data, segmented pricing, regional storefronts, and approval workflows.</p> <div class="services__link"> <svg width="16" height="10" viewbox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M.985 4.852v1.233h12.849l-2.43 3.187 1.125.712L15.983 5.5l-3.5-4.516-1.125.712 2.43 3.188L.986 4.852z" fill="#fff"></path></svg> </div> </a> </div> <div class="col services__col"> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/replatforming/" target="_self" class="services__block"> <h3>Replatform without revenue disruption</h3> <p>Move from Magento, WooCommerce, custom builds, Shopify, BigCommerce, Salesforce Commerce Cloud, or commercetools with phased, revenue-safe ecommerce replatforming.</p> <div class="services__link"> <svg width="16" height="10" viewbox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M.985 4.852v1.233h12.849l-2.43 3.187 1.125.712L15.983 5.5l-3.5-4.516-1.125.712 2.43 3.188L.986 4.852z" fill="#fff"></path></svg> </div> </a> </div> <div class="col services__col"> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/systems-integration/" target="_self" class="services__block"> <h3>Integrate commerce with ERP, PIM, CRM, OMS</h3> <p>ERP ecommerce integration for SAP S/4HANA, NetSuite, Microsoft Dynamics 365, Infor, Epicor, Odoo, plus Akeneo, Pimcore, WMS, 3PL, and custom middleware.</p> <div class="services__link"> <svg width="16" height="10" viewbox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M.985 4.852v1.233h12.849l-2.43 3.187 1.125.712L15.983 5.5l-3.5-4.516-1.125.712 2.43 3.188L.986 4.852z" fill="#fff"></path></svg> </div> </a> </div> <div class="col services__col"> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/ecommerce-rescue-refactor-stabilization-services/" target="_self" class="services__block"> <h3>Rescue a delayed or failed ecommerce project</h3> <p>Audit architecture, stabilize performance, refactor technical debt, recover Core Web Vitals, and take over from another vendor with a prioritized remediation plan.</p> <div class="services__link"> <svg width="16" height="10" viewbox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M.985 4.852v1.233h12.849l-2.43 3.187 1.125.712L15.983 5.5l-3.5-4.516-1.125.712 2.43 3.188L.986 4.852z" fill="#fff"></path></svg> </div> </a> </div> <div class="col services__col"> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/ecommerce-consulting-services/" target="_self" class="services__block"> <h3>Plan the right platform and architecture</h3> <p>Assess platform fit, map B2B workflows and integrations, define solution architecture, delivery phases, risks, and total cost of ownership before development begins.</p> <div class="services__link"> <svg width="16" height="10" viewbox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M.985 4.852v1.233h12.849l-2.43 3.187 1.125.712L15.983 5.5l-3.5-4.516-1.125.712 2.43 3.188L.986 4.852z" fill="#fff"></path></svg> </div> </a> </div> <div class="col services__col"> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/ecommerce-support-services/" target="_self" class="services__block"> <h3>Support and optimize commerce after launch</h3> <p>Keep business-critical commerce stable with SLA-backed maintenance, security patching, performance monitoring, integration support, platform upgrades, and continuous improvement.</p> <div class="services__link"> <svg width="16" height="10" viewbox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M.985 4.852v1.233h12.849l-2.43 3.187 1.125.712L15.983 5.5l-3.5-4.516-1.125.712 2.43 3.188L.986 4.852z" fill="#fff"></path></svg> </div> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div></section> <section class="engagement table table--flexible-cols"> <div class="container"> <h2 class="engagement-title">B2B engagement at a glance</h2> <div class="table-wrapper"> <table> <thead> <tr> <th scope="col" class="nitro-lazy">Engagement</th> <th scope="col" class="nitro-lazy">Typical timeline</th> <th scope="col" class="nitro-lazy">Typical investment</th> <th scope="col" class="nitro-lazy">Best for</th> <th scope="col" class="nitro-lazy">Proof</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td class="nitro-lazy">B2B portal build</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Scoped after discovery</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Scoped after discovery</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Manufacturers and distributors adding self-service ordering</td> <td class="nitro-lazy"><a href="/projects/armacell/">Armacell case</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td class="nitro-lazy">Replatforming / migration</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Scoped after discovery</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Within the $25,000–$500,000+ overall range</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Revenue-safe moves off legacy or constrained platforms</td> <td class="nitro-lazy"><a href="/projects/benum/">Benum case</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td class="nitro-lazy">ERP integration</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Scoped after discovery</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Scoped after discovery</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">SAP, NetSuite, and Microsoft Dynamics 365-connected commerce</td> <td class="nitro-lazy"><a href="/projects/armacell/">Armacell</a> / <a href="/projects/pethq-b2b-website/">PetHQ</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td class="nitro-lazy">Rescue &amp; stabilization</td> <td class="nitro-lazy"> Scoped after discovery</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Scoped after discovery</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Delayed or failed implementations and vendor takeovers</td> <td class="nitro-lazy"><a href="/projects/revamping-online-electronics-store-with-hyva-theme/">DIGI case</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td class="nitro-lazy">Managed support</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">SLA-backed retainer</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Scoped after discovery</td> <td class="nitro-lazy">Post-launch operations, upgrades, monitoring, and continuous improvement</td> <td class="nitro-lazy"><a href="https://clutch.co/go-to-review/deee446f-d3ad-401c-9803-44a2392c73da/6144" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hanes review</a> / <a href="https://clutch.co/profile/elogic-commerce?page=3#review-170842" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WTG review</a></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> </div> </section> <section class="portal-workflows"> <div class="container"> <div class="portal-workflows__header"> <h2>ERP-connected portals and order workflows for <span>manufacturers, distributors, and wholesalers</span></h2> <p>Elogic Commerce builds the ordering layer B2B operators run on: customer, vendor, marketplace, dealer, and wholesale portals connected with ERP systems, account-specific pricing, quote workflows, purchase orders, PunchOut, and EDI.</p> </div> <div class="portal-workflows__grid"> <article class="portal-workflows__card"> <span class="portal-workflows__number" aria-hidden="true">01</span> <div class="portal-workflows__card-content"> <h3>B2B customer portals</h3> <p>Give business customers secure self-service access to account-specific catalogs, contract pricing, order history, invoices, quick ordering, and repeat purchases.</p> <p><a href="/services/b2b-customer-portal-development/">Explore customer portals</a></p> </div> </article> <article class="portal-workflows__card"> <span class="portal-workflows__number" aria-hidden="true">02</span> <div class="portal-workflows__card-content"> <h3>Vendor portals</h3> <p>Centralize supplier onboarding, product data, documents, inventory updates, purchase orders, approvals, and communication in one connected workspace.</p> <p><a href="/services/b2b-vendor-portal/">Explore vendor portals</a></p> </div> </article> <article class="portal-workflows__card"> <span class="portal-workflows__number" aria-hidden="true">03</span> <div class="portal-workflows__card-content"> <h3>Marketplace portals</h3> <p>Connect multiple sellers, distributors, or business units through shared catalogs, seller workflows, order routing, commissions, permissions, and reporting.</p> <p><a href="/services/b2b-marketplace-portal-development/">Explore marketplace portals</a></p> </div> </article> <article class="portal-workflows__card"> <span class="portal-workflows__number" aria-hidden="true">04</span> <div class="portal-workflows__card-content"> <h3>Wholesale and dealer self-service</h3> <p>Support distributors, dealers, and&nbsp;<a href="/solutions/b2b-wholesale-ecommerce/">wholesalers</a> with pricing tiers, credit limits, branch-level accounts, purchase approvals, and assisted ordering.</p> <p><a href="/solutions/b2b-wholesale-ecommerce/">Explore wholesale ecommerce</a></p> </div> </article> </div> <div class="portal-workflows__capabilities"> <div class="portal-workflows__capability"> <h3>Commerce workflows</h3> <p>Operational purchasing processes built into the customer experience.</p> <ul> <li>Account-specific pricing and catalogs</li> <li>RFQ and quote approval workflows</li> <li>Purchase orders and net payment terms</li> <li>Quick-order and repeat-order flows</li> <li>Role-based permissions and credit limits</li> </ul> </div> <div class="portal-workflows__capability"> <h3>ERP and procurement connectivity</h3> <p>Commerce synchronized with the systems your teams already operate.</p> <ul> <li>SAP S/4HANA</li> <li>NetSuite</li> <li>Microsoft Dynamics 365</li> <li>PunchOut catalogs</li> <li>EDI and custom middleware</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="process"> <div class="container"> <div class="process__control"> <div class="col"> <div class="process__heading"> <h2>How We Deliver: <span>Structured, Governed, Accountable</span></h2> </div> <p>We use AI-assisted engineering for analysis, QA, migration, and optimization where it improves delivery. Architecture, security, code review, and release decisions remain engineer-led.</p> </div> <div class="col"> <div class="process__slider-control"> <div class="swiper-button-prev process__swiper-prev"> <svg width="16" height="10" viewbox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M15.015 5.148V3.915H2.166L4.596.728 3.471.016.017 4.5l3.5 4.516 1.124-.712-2.43-3.188 12.804.032z" fill="#fff"></path></svg> </div> <div class="swiper-button-next process__swiper-next"> <svg width="16" height="10" viewbox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M.985 4.852v1.233h12.849l-2.43 3.187 1.125.712L15.983 5.5l-3.5-4.516-1.125.712 2.43 3.188L.986 4.852z" fill="#fff"></path></svg> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="swiper-container process__swiper"> <div class="swiper-wrapper"> <div class="swiper-slide"> <div class="process__block"> <div class="step"> Step 1 </div> <h3>Discovery &amp; Requirements</h3> <p><a href="https://elogic.co/services/ecommerce-discovery-and-planning-services/">Define business requirements, integration dependencies, platform fit, and success criteria. Scope and milestones reflect verified requirements — not assumptions.</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="swiper-slide"> <div class="process__block"> <div class="step"> Step 2 </div> <h3>Architecture &amp; Prototyping</h3> <p><a href="https://elogic.co/services/solution-architecture/">Validate critical flows, integration architecture, and B2B workflows through prototyping and technical spikes before full build commitment.</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="swiper-slide"> <div class="process__block"> <div class="step"> Step 3 </div> <h3>Development &amp; Integration</h3> <p>Senior-led, squad-delivered engineering with CI/CD, code review, and QA gates. Milestone-based progress with RACI and change management controls.</p> </div> </div> <div class="swiper-slide"> <div class="process__block"> <div class="step"> Step 4 </div> <h3>QA, Performance &amp; Security</h3> <p>Functional testing, load testing, security review, and Core Web Vitals optimization before launch.</p> </div> </div> <div class="swiper-slide"> <div class="process__block"> <div class="step"> Step 5 </div> <h3>Go-Live &amp; Stabilization</h3> <p>Controlled deployment, monitoring, and post-launch stabilization.</p> </div> </div> <div class="swiper-slide"> <div class="process__block"> <div class="step"> Step 6 </div> <h3>Ongoing Support &amp; Optimization</h3> <p><a href="https://elogic.co/services/ecommerce-support-services/">Long-term managed services with defined SLAs, performance monitoring, and continuous improvement.</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="swiper-pagination process__swiper-pagination"></div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="badges"> <div class="container"> <div class="badges__heading"> <h2><span>Awards &amp; Accolades</span></h2> </div> <div class="swiper-container badges__swiper"> <div class="swiper-wrapper"> <div class="swiper-slide"> <div class="image badges__image object-fit"> <img width="300" height="300" alt="Clutch Global Fall 2025" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" title="Clutch Global Fall 2025" nitro-lazy-srcset="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Clutch-Global-Fall-2025.webp 300w, https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Clutch-Global-Fall-2025-150x150.webp 150w, https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Clutch-Global-Fall-2025-292x292.webp 292w, https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Clutch-Global-Fall-2025-24x24.webp 24w, https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Clutch-Global-Fall-2025-48x48.webp 48w, https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Clutch-Global-Fall-2025-96x96.webp 96w" 