<path d="M7.518.94l1.772 5.4h5.735l-4.64 3.338 1.773 5.4-4.64-3.337-4.64 3.337 1.773-5.4L.011 6.34h5.735L7.518.94z" fill="#1C1C1C"></path></svg> </div> </div> <div> <div class="clutch-info"> <p>Powered by</p> <img width="196" height="57" alt="clutch-co" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/themes/elogic/resources/images/home/clutch-co.svg" class="nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MjMyMDoxNjY=-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MjMyMDoxNjY=-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTk2IDU3IiB3aWR0aD0iMTk2IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjU3IiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" /> </div> </div> </a> </div> <div class="col clutch-sec__col"> <a href="https://clutch.co/go-to-review/deee446f-d3ad-401c-9803-44a2392c73da/6144" target="_self" class="clutch-sec__item"> <div> <div class="rating"> <span>5.0</span> <div class="rating-star"> <svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg> </div> </div> <p>"After launch we have seen an increase in both order volume and order value, as well as getting a website that is much easier to manage for our employees and better integrated with other internal systems than the previous solution."</p> </div> <div> <div class="author"> Group IT Ecommerce Manager, <br /> <span>Hanes Brands Australasia</span> </div> <div class="industry"> Apparel &amp; Fashion </div> </div> </a> </div> <div class="col clutch-sec__col"> <a href="https://clutch.co/go-to-review/deee446f-d3ad-401c-9803-44a2392c73da/170842" target="_self" class="clutch-sec__item"> <div> <div class="rating"> <span>5.0</span> <div class="rating-star"> <svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg> </div> </div> <p>"Our conversion rate increased by 15–20% compared to our former website. The new site had faster page loading times. Their team was fast and met the goals we wanted to achieve in a straightforward manner."</p> </div> <div> <div class="author"> Executive Assistant <br /> <span>WTG Spain</span> </div> <div class="industry"> Real Estate / Marketplace </div> </div> </a> </div> <div class="col clutch-sec__col"> <a href="https://clutch.co/go-to-review/deee446f-d3ad-401c-9803-44a2392c73da/390158" target="_self" class="clutch-sec__item"> <div> <div class="rating"> <span>5.0</span> <div class="rating-star"> <svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg><svg width="18" height="17" viewbox="0 0 18 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.703.516l2.002 6.1h6.477l-5.24 3.77 2 6.099-5.24-3.77-5.239 3.77 2-6.1-5.239-3.77h6.477l2.002-6.1z" fill="#FC3F38"></path></svg> </div> </div> <p>"We appreciated how clear and actionable Elogic Commerce’s recommendations were. Their Shopify audit and optimization guidance helped us improve conversion performance, reduce bounce rate, increase organic traffic, and make the store faster and easier to use."</p> </div> <div> <div class="author"> Head of Marketing <br /> <span>Smarttek Solutions</span> </div> <div class="industry"> IT Services </div> </div> </a> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="why-sec"> <div class="container"> <div class="why-sec__heading"> <h2>Why Mid-Market and Enterprise Teams <span>Choose Elogic Commerce</span></h2> </div> <div class="why-sec__subheading"> </div> <div class="flex why-sec__flex"> <div class="col why-sec__col"> <div class="why-sec__block"> <h3>Commerce-Only Focus,<br /> Since 2009</h3> <p>We work exclusively in ecommerce. No mobile apps, no marketing campaigns, no generic IT outsourcing. Every engineer, architect, and project manager has deep commerce platform experience.</p> </div> </div> <div class="col why-sec__col"> <div class="why-sec__block"> <h3>The Safer<br /> Middle Path</h3> <p>Too complex for freelancers? Too focused for a global consultancy? Elogic Commerce delivers enterprise-grade commerce engineering with specialist teams, structured governance, and accountable delivery - without the overhead of a global network.</p> </div> </div> <div class="col why-sec__col"> <div class="why-sec__block"> <h3>ERP-Led Integration<br /> Expertise</h3> <p>We have delivered production integrations with SAP S/4HANA, NetSuite, Microsoft Dynamics 365, Oracle ERP Cloud, Infor, Epicor, Salesforce CRM, Akeneo, and Pimcore - engineering bidirectional data flows that keep pricing, inventory, and orders accurate across systems.</p> </div> </div> <div class="col why-sec__col"> <div class="why-sec__block"> <h3>Delivery Governance<br /> You Can Verify</h3> <p>Every project follows a structured delivery framework: defined discovery, milestone-based delivery, RACI accountability, change management controls, and transparent progress reporting. Our approach is documented in our public Risk Register (/risk-register/). NPS 70, measured post-launch.</p> </div> </div> <div class="col why-sec__col"> <div class="why-sec__block"> <h3>Rescue &amp; Recovery<br /> Capability</h3> <p>We regularly take over projects that have failed with other agencies - stabilizing stores, refactoring poor-quality code, resolving performance issues, and getting stalled migrations back on track.</p> </div> </div> <div class="col why-sec__col"> <div class="why-sec__block"> <h3>Platform-Neutral<br /> Recommendation</h3> <p>Elogic Commerce is platform-agnostic by design. Adobe Commerce, Shopify Plus, BigCommerce, Salesforce <a href="https://elogic.co/blog/what-is-salesforce-commerce-cloud/" style="color:#30466d">Commerce Cloud</a>, commercetools, or a composable stack - the recommendation follows your workflows, integration depth, total cost of ownership, and governance requirements. Compare options with the Ecommerce Platform Selector.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="why-sec__items-wrapper"> <h2 class="why-sec__items-title"> <span>Trusted</span> by global brands. Independently reviewed on Clutch. Verifiable in official partner directories. </h2> <div class="why-sec__items"> <div class=" why-sec__image why-sec__item object-fit"> <img width="300" height="200" alt="Hanes" title="Hanes" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/hanes-logo.webp" class="attachment-full size-full nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MjQzNDoyMTI=-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MjQzNDoyMTI=-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMzAwIDIwMCIgd2lkdGg9IjMwMCIgaGVpZ2h0PSIyMDAiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyI+PC9zdmc+" /> </div> <a href="https://elogic.co/projects/disney/" class="why-sec__item why-sec__link"> <span class="sr-only">http://Disney</span> <div class=" why-sec__image object-fit"> <img width="300" height="200" alt="Disney" title="Disney" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/disney-logo.webp" class="attachment-full size-full nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MjQzODoyMTk=-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MjQzODoyMTk=-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMzAwIDIwMCIgd2lkdGg9IjMwMCIgaGVpZ2h0PSIyMDAiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyI+PC9zdmc+" /> </div> </a> <div class=" why-sec__image why-sec__item object-fit"> <img width="300" height="200" alt="Philips Healthcare" title="Philips Healthcare" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/philips-logo.webp" class="attachment-full size-full nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MjQ0MToyNDA=-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MjQ0MToyNDA=-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMzAwIDIwMCIgd2lkdGg9IjMwMCIgaGVpZ2h0PSIyMDAiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyI+PC9zdmc+" /> </div> <div class=" why-sec__image why-sec__item object-fit"> <img width="300" height="200" alt="Accenture" title="Accenture" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/accenture-logo.webp" class="attachment-full size-full nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MjQ0MzoyMjQ=-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MjQ0MzoyMjQ=-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMzAwIDIwMCIgd2lkdGg9IjMwMCIgaGVpZ2h0PSIyMDAiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyI+PC9zdmc+" /> </div> <a href="https://elogic.co/projects/armacell/" class="why-sec__item why-sec__link"> <span class="sr-only">http://Armacell</span> <div class=" why-sec__image object-fit"> <img width="300" height="200" alt="Armacell" title="Armacell" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/armacell-logo.webp" class="attachment-full