6667 18 10 18V18M10 10V10V10V10V10V10V10V10V10V10" fill="#30466D" fill-opacity="0.4"></path> </svg> </span> <div class="content"> <h4>Simple B2C Needs</h4> <p class="text">You need a simple, low-budget B2C storefront without complex integrations or workflows.</p> </div> </div> <div class="fit__item no-fit__item"> <span class="icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewbox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M6.4 15L10 11.4L13.6 15L15 13.6L11.4 10L15 6.4L13.6 5L10 8.6L6.4 5L5 6.4L8.6 10L5 13.6L6.4 15V15M10 20C8.61667 20 7.31667 19.7375 6.1 19.2125C4.88333 18.6875 3.825 17.975 2.925 17.075C2.025 16.175 1.3125 15.1167 0.7875 13.9C0.2625 12.6833 0 11.3833 0 10C0 8.61667 0.2625 7.31667 0.7875 6.1C1.3125 4.88333 2.025 3.825 2.925 2.925C3.825 2.025 4.88333 1.3125 6.1 0.7875C7.31667 0.2625 8.61667 0 10 0C11.3833 0 12.6833 0.2625 13.9 0.7875C15.1167 1.3125 16.175 2.025 17.075 2.925C17.975 3.825 18.6875 4.88333 19.2125 6.1C19.7375 7.31667 20 8.61667 20 10C20 11.3833 19.7375 12.6833 19.2125 13.9C18.6875 15.1167 17.975 16.175 17.075 17.075C16.175 17.975 15.1167 18.6875 13.9 19.2125C12.6833 19.7375 11.3833 20 10 20V20M10 18C12.2333 18 14.125 17.225 15.675 15.675C17.225 14.125 18 12.2333 18 10C18 7.76667 17.225 5.875 15.675 4.325C14.125 2.775 12.2333 2 10 2C7.76667 2 5.875 2.775 4.325 4.325C2.775 5.875 2 7.76667 2 10C2 12.2333 2.775 14.125 4.325 15.675C5.875 17.225 7.76667 18 10 18V18M10 10V10V10V10V10V10V10V10V10V10" fill="#30466D" fill-opacity="0.4"></path> </svg> </span> <div class="content"> <h4>Creative Agency Focus</h4> <p class="text">Your primary need is brand identity, high-concept creative direction, or visual storytelling.</p> </div> </div> <div class="fit__item no-fit__item"> <span class="icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewbox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M6.4 15L10 11.4L13.6 15L15 13.6L11.4 10L15 6.4L13.6 5L10 8.6L6.4 5L5 6.4L8.6 10L5 13.6L6.4 15V15M10 20C8.61667 20 7.31667 19.7375 6.1 19.2125C4.8