-zoho-crm-integration/" class="service"> Zoho </a> </div> </div> <div class="integrations__block"> <div class="block-header"> <span class="icon"> <svg width="20" height="20" viewbox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M3 20C2.45 20 1.97917 19.8042 1.5875 19.4125C1.19583 19.0208 1 18.55 1 18V6.725C0.7 6.54167 0.458333 6.30417 0.275 6.0125C0.0916667 5.72083 0 5.38333 0 5V2C0 1.45 0.195833 0.979167 0.5875 0.5875C0.979167 0.195833 1.45 0 2 0H18C18.55 0 19.0208 0.195833 19.4125 0.5875C19.8042 0.979167 20 1.45 20 2V5C20 5.38333 19.9083 5.72083 19.725 6.0125C19.5417 6.30417 19.3 6.54167 19 6.725V18C19 18.55 18.8042 19.0208 18.4125 19.4125C18.0208 19.8042 17.55 20 17 20H3V20M3 7V18V18V18H17V18V18V7H3V7M2 5H18V5V5V2V2V2H2V2V2V5V5V5V5M7 12H13V10H7V12V12M10 12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5V12.5" fill="#30466D"></path> </svg> </span> <h3>PIM</h3> </div> <div class="block-services"> <a href="https://elogic.co/integrations/akeneo-magento-integration/" class="service"> Akeneo </a> <a href="https://elogic.co/integrations/pimcore-magento-integration/" class="service"> Pimcore </a> <a href="https://elogic.co/integrations/inriver-magento-integration/" class="service"> inriver </a> </div> </div> <div class="integrations__block"> <div class="block-header"> <span class="icon"> <svg width="19" height="18" viewbox="0 0 19 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M2 16V16V16V16V16V16V16V16V2V2V2V2V2V2V2V2C2 2 2 2.37083 2 3.1125C2 3.85417 2 4.81667 2 6V12C2 13.1833 2 14.1458 2 14.8875C2 15.6292 2 16 2 16V16M2 18C1.45 18 0.979167 17.8042 0.5875 17.4125C0.195833 17.0208 0 16.55 0 16V2C0 1.45 0.195833 0.979167 0.5875 0.5875C0.979167 0.195833 1.45 0 2 0H16C16.55 0 17.0208 0.195833 17.4125 0.5875C17.8042 0.979167 18 1.45 18 2V4.5H16V2V2V2H2V2V2V16V16V16H16V16V16V13.5H18V16C18 16.55 17.8042 17.0208 17.4125 17.4125C17.0208 17.8042 16.55 18 16 18H2V18M10 14C9.45 14 8.97917 13.8042 8.5875 13.4125C8.19583 13.0208 8 12.55 8 12V6C8 5.45 8.