55 10 5 10C5.45 10 5.85833 10.0917 6.225 10.275C6.59167 10.4583 6.91667 10.7 7.2 11H14V2H2V11ZM17 14C17.2833 14 17.5208 13.9042 17.7125 13.7125C17.9042 13.5208 18 13.2833 18 13C18 12.7167 17.9042 12.4792 17.7125 12.2875C17.5208 12.0958 17.2833 12 17 12C16.7167 12 16.4792 12.0958 16.2875 12.2875C16.0958 12.4792 16 12.7167 16 13C16 13.2833 16.0958 13.5208 16.2875 13.7125C16.4792 13.9042 16.7167 14 17 14ZM16 9H20.25L18 6H16V9Z" fill="#30466D"></path> </svg> </span> <h3>OMS / Other</h3> </div> <div class="block-services"> <a href="https://elogic.co/integrations/" class="service"> EDI/PunchOut </a> <a href="https://elogic.co/integrations/shipstation-magento-integration/" class="service"> ShipStation </a> <a href="https://elogic.co/integrations/avalara-magento-integration/" class="service"> Avalara </a> </div> </div> <div class="integrations__block last-block"> <h3 class="last-block__title">Looking for something else?</h3> <p class="last-block__subtitle">We support 50+ enterprise integrations and custom API builds.</p> <a href="https://elogic.co/integrations/" class="last-block__link"> Explore all integrations <svg width="25" height="24" viewbox="0 0 25 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M14.9311 18.8201C14.7411 18.8201 14.5511 18.7501 14.4011 18.6001C14.1111 18.3101 14.1111 17.8301 14.4011 17.5401L19.9411 12.0001L14.4011 6.46012C14.1111 6.17012 14.1111 5.69012 14.4011 5.40012C14.6911 5.11012 15.1711 5.11012 15.4611 5.40012L21.5311 11.4701C21.8211 11.7601 21.8211 12.2401 21.5311 12.5301L15.4611 18.6001C15.3111 18.7501 15.1211 18.8201 14.9311 18.8201Z" fill="currentColor"></path> <path d="M20.83 12.75H4C3.59 12.75 3.25 12.41 3.25 12C3.25 11.59 3.59 11.25 4 11.25H20.83C21.24 11.25 21.58 11.59 21.58 12C21.58 12.41 21.24 12.75 20.83 12.75Z" fill="currentColor"></path> </svg> </a> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="section so-faq home-faq"> <div class="container"> <div class="faq-content"> <div class="title title__h"> <h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Working <span>with Elogic Commerce</span></h2> </div> <div class="text text-1"> </div>  <div class="faq-items faq-section  faq-items--2-col"> <div class="faq-col"> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-1" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-1"> <h3>Who is Elogic Commerce, and what's the company's background?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-1"> <div> <p>Elogic Commerce is an ecommerce engineering and consulting company founded in 2009, with 200+ specialists and 500+ projects delivered. The company is headquartered in Tallinn, Estonia, with offices in Prague, Munich, Dresden, Amsterdam, Stockholm, London, New York</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-3" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-3"> <h3>How does Elogic Commerce manage risk and delivery governance?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-3"> <div> <p>Every project follows a structured framework: defined discovery, signed scope, milestone-based delivery, RACI accountability, change management controls, and transparent reporting. Our governance approach is publicly documented in our Risk Register (/risk-register/).</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-5" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-5"> <h3>Do you handle complex ERP, CRM, and PIM integrations?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-5"> <div> <p>Elogic Commerce delivers production integrations between ecommerce platforms and ERP, CRM, PIM, OMS, and other enterprise systems. Our integration experience includes SAP S/4HANA, NetSuite, Microsoft Dynamics 365, Oracle ERP Cloud, Infor, Epicor, Salesforce CRM, Akeneo, and Pimcore, including bidirectional data flows for pricing, inventory, customers, and orders.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-7" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-7"> <h3>Does Elogic Commerce build customer, dealer, vendor, and self-service portals?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-7"> <div> <p>Yes. Elogic Commerce builds B2B <a href="https://elogic.co/services/b2b-customer-portal-development/">customer portals</a>, dealer and distributor portals, supplier and <a href="https://elogic.co/services/b2b-vendor-portal/">vendor portals</a>, sales-rep assisted ordering, and wholesale buyer portals when they are part of an ERP-connected commerce architecture — with role-based permissions, customer-specific pricing, quote workflows, purchase orders, PunchOut catalogs, and EDI.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-9" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-9"> <h3>Is Elogic Commerce a good fit for a mid-sized B2B manufacturer?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-9"> <div> <p>Elogic Commerce is a strong fit for mid-market B2B manufacturers and distributors with complex commerce workflows or backend integrations. We help teams move from manual or legacy sales processes to digital commerce through requirements definition, platform selection, B2B workflow engineering, ERP integration, account-specific pricing, quoting, approvals, and self-service ordering.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-11" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-11"> <h3>Do you work with organizations outside of B2B?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-11"> <div> <p>Yes. While B2B and B2B2C is our core specialization, we also deliver for complex B2C environments where platform choice, integrations, and operational complexity are significant — across manufacturing, fashion, consumer electronics, health and beauty, and luxury goods.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-13" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-13"> <h3>How much does ecommerce development cost?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-13"> <div> <p>Most engagements fall between $25,000 and $500,000+, depending on platform complexity, integration depth, number of storefronts, and scope of custom development. A focused <a style="color:#30466d" href="https://elogic.co/blog/b2b-portal/">B2B portal</a> build with one ERP integration typically starts at $75,000–$150,000. Enterprise replatforming programs with multi-system integration, global rollout, and ongoing support are typically $200,000–$500,000+. We provide detailed estimates after discovery, with milestone-based billing and transparent change management so there are no surprises.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-15" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-15"> <h3>Can Elogic Commerce take over and stabilize a troubled build from another vendor?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-15"> <div> <p>Elogic Commerce runs structured rescue and recovery engagements for troubled Adobe Commerce, Shopify Plus, BigCommerce, Salesforce Commerce Cloud, and composable implementations. Typical work includes technical audits, codebase triage, performance remediation, infrastructure stabilization, technical-debt reduction, and a prioritized roadmap for either recovering the existing implementation or replatforming where necessary.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-col"> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-2" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-2"> <h3>What types of ecommerce projects is Elogic Commerce best suited for?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-2"> <div> <p>Elogic Commerce is best suited for complex ecommerce programs where platform choice, integrations, and delivery quality have material business impact. That includes B2B and B2B2C commerce, replatforming, multi-store and multi-region environments, ERP / CRM / PIM / OMS integrations, and workflows such as customer-specific pricing, approvals, quoting, and self-service ordering. We are typically the strongest fit for mid-market and enterprise businesses rather than very small, low-complexity builds.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-4" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-4"> <h3>How do you choose the right ecommerce platform?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-4"> <div> <p>We are platform-neutral with delivery experience across Adobe Commerce (Magento), Shopify Plus, BigCommerce, Salesforce Commerce Cloud, and commercetools. Recommendations are based on business requirements, integration landscape, total cost of ownership, and operating model. We offer platform assessments as standalone engagements.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-6" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-6"> <h3>What happens after go-live?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-6"> <div> <p>Many client relationships extend years beyond the initial build. Post-launch support includes development, maintenance, performance monitoring, security patching, and platform upgrades — with defined SLAs and senior-led engineering squads. We offer retainer-based and project-based models.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-8" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-8"> <h3>How does Elogic Commerce compare to freelancers or large consultancies?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-8"> <div> <p>Elogic Commerce is positioned between small development teams and large global consultancies for commerce programs that require specialist platform expertise, structured governance, and a multidisciplinary engineering team. The best fit depends on project complexity, integration requirements, internal capabilities, delivery model, and budget. Elogic Commerce focuses specifically on ecommerce engineering rather than broad IT consulting.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-10" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-10"> <h3>What engagement models do you offer?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-10"> <div> <p>Three primary models: fixed-price (defined scope, milestone delivery), time-and-materials (flexible scope, transparent billing), and dedicated teams (embedded engineers as an extension of your team). Each includes structured project management, QA, and progress reporting.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-12" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-12"> <h3>What does a typical engagement timeline look like?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-12"> <div> <p>Timelines depend on project complexity and scope. A mid-market B2B program with ERP integration, account-based pricing, and PIM connectivity typically runs 6–12 months from discovery to go-live. Programs with legacy ERP complexity, concurrent OMS or WMS integration, or multi-country scope typically run 12–18 months. Simpler storefront builds or platform upgrades can be completed in 8–16 weeks. We do not commit to firm timelines before discovery and architecture review are complete — because realistic planning protects your budget and your launch.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-14" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-14"> <h3>Does Elogic Commerce provide long-term support for critical ecommerce operations?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-14"> <div> <p>Yes. Elogic Commerce supports long-term optimization and managed evolution for complex ecommerce systems, including post-launch stabilization, performance optimization, feature development, architecture oversight, and ongoing support for integration-heavy operations. Elogic Commerce is strongest where reliability, governance, and delivery continuity matter after go-live, not just during implementation.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-item"> <button class="name faq-question" id="faq-question-35805-16" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-35805-16"> <h3>What size companies does Elogic Commerce work with?</h3> </button> <div class="desc faq-answer" id="faq-answer-35805-16"> <div> <p>Elogic Commerce works with mid-market and focused enterprise teams - typically manufacturers, distributors, wholesalers, and hybrid B2B/B2C companies where platform choice, integrations, and delivery quality have a material business impact. We are the strongest fit when commerce operations depend on multiple backend integrations, custom pricing, approvals, RFQ workflows, or account hierarchies, and less suited to simple, low-budget storefront builds.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <section class="contact-section"> <div class="container"> <div class="contact-wrapper"> <div class="contact-info-block"> <div class="wrapper"> <h2 class="title">Let’s talk</h2> <p class="subtitle">Elogic Commerce builds, migrates, and optimizes complex ecommerce systems for mid-market and enterprise teams. Tell us what you are working on — we will come back with an honest assessment of fit, scope, and timeline.</p> <ul class="contacts-block"> <li class="contact-item email"> <a href="mailto:office@elogic.co" class="contact-link" id="form_footer_click_email" aria-label="Send email to Elogic"> <span> <svg width="16" height="16" viewbox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <g clip-path="url(#clip0_203_377)"> <path d="M0.816667 5.64491C0.887333 5.56291 5.65333 0.96624 5.65333 0.96624C6.28153 0.349903 7.12699 0.00546067 8.00705 0.0073318C8.88711 0.00920294 9.7311 0.357238 10.3567 0.97624C10.3567 0.97624 15.1127 5.56291 15.1827 5.64291L9.414 11.4122C9.03288 11.7755 8.52654 11.9782 8 11.9782C7.47346 11.9782 6.96712 11.7755 6.586 11.4122L0.816667 5.64491ZM10.3567 12.3576C9.72952 12.9786 8.8826 13.327 8 13.327C7.1174 13.327 6.27048 12.9786 5.64333 12.3576L0.152667 6.86691C0.0568332 7.17081 0.00541308 7.48696 0 7.80557L0 12.6669C0.00105857 13.5506 0.352588 14.3979 0.97748 15.0228C1.60237 15.6477 2.4496 15.9992 3.33333 16.0002H12.6667C13.5504 15.9992 14.3976 15.6477 15.0225 15.0228C15.6474 14.3979 15.9989 13.5506 16 12.6669V7.80557C15.9946 7.48696 15.9432 7.17081 15.8473 6.86691L10.3567 12.3576Z" fill="white"></path> </g> <defs> <clippath id="clip0_203_377"> <rect width="16" height="16" fill="white"></rect> </clippath> </defs> </svg> </span> office@elogic.co </a> </li> <li class="contact-item phone"> <a href="tel:+15125390265" class="contact-link" id="form_footer_click_phone_us" aria-label="Call to Elogic US office"> <span> <svg width="16" height="16" viewbox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M14.7622 14.774L15.3687 14.0748C15.7548 13.6875 15.9716 13.1629 15.9716 12.6161C15.9716 12.0692 15.7548 11.5447 15.3687 11.1574C15.3481 11.1367 13.7444 9.90301 13.7444 9.90301C13.3595 9.53665 12.8483 9.33264 12.3169 9.33339C11.7856 9.33413 11.2749 9.53957 10.8911 9.90701L9.62066 10.9774C8.58367 10.5483 7.64168 9.91846 6.84879 9.1242C6.05589 8.32993 5.42772 7.38685 5.00034 6.34912L6.06677 5.08273C6.4345 4.69893 6.64018 4.18818 6.64105 3.65664C6.64191 3.12511 6.43791 2.61369 6.07143 2.22869C6.07143 2.22869 4.83637 0.627036 4.81571 0.606374C4.43543 0.223623 3.91983 0.00585318 3.38031 0.000116274C2.84079 -0.00562063 2.32067 0.201136 1.93234 0.575714L1.16584 1.24224C-3.36251 6.49576 6.3887 16.1716 11.8155 15.9977C12.3635 16.0009 12.9066 15.8942 13.4127 15.684C13.9188 15.4738 14.3777 15.1644 14.7622 14.774Z" fill="white"></path> </svg> </span>US +1(512) 539 0265 </a> <a href="tel:+46851971312" class="contact-link" id="form_footer_click_phone_eu" aria-label="Call to Elogic EU office"> EU +46 8 519 71 312 </a> </li> <li class="contact-item whatsapp"> <a href="https://wa.me/+380507641000/?text=Hello" class="contact-link" id="form_footer_click_whatsapp" aria-label="Text to Elogic via WhatsApp"> <span> <svg width="17" height="16" viewbox="0 0 17 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M0 7.99993C0 3.58843 3.61776 0 8.06533 0V0.000132786H8.07001C12.5176 0.000132786 16.1353 3.58856 16.1353 8.00007C16.1353 12.4114 12.5176 16 8.07001 16C6.42941 16 4.90736 15.5157 3.63195 14.6785L0.530989 15.6613L1.53623 12.689C0.568993 11.372 0 9.74948 0 7.99993ZM5.30102 3.66903C5.53802 3.67859 5.65658 3.69266 5.81301 4.06418C5.86354 4.18514 5.93295 4.35216 6.00902 4.53521C6.22568 5.05655 6.49634 5.70784 6.53844 5.79488C6.59531 5.91248 6.65232 6.07243 6.57162 6.22759C6.50104 6.37638 6.43868 6.44787 6.33488 6.56686C6.32709 6.57578 6.31908 6.58496 6.31081 6.59447C6.26007 6.65286 6.21022 6.7052 6.16049 6.75741C6.09401 6.8272 6.02777 6.89674 5.95994 6.98019C5.95805 6.9824 5.95614 6.98461 5.95424 6.98683C5.8468 7.11187 5.73003 7.24776 5.8652 7.47873C6.00263 7.70916 6.47675 8.47569 7.1738 9.0917C8.00106 9.82146 8.68426 10.0955 8.99242 10.2191C9.01989 10.2301 9.04438 10.2399 9.06572 10.2487C9.26002 10.3288 9.49246 10.3099 9.63471 10.1594C9.78891 9.99454 9.97424 9.73663 10.1671 9.46826C10.1997 9.4229 10.2325 9.37724 10.2654 9.33169C10.4265 9.10591 10.6303 9.07763 10.8438 9.15754C11.0619 9.2328 12.2142 9.79718 12.4512 9.91478C12.4996 9.93883 12.5446 9.96031 12.5862 9.98011C12.748 10.0573 12.8563 10.109 12.9016 10.1875C12.9586 10.2863 12.9586 10.7519 12.7642 11.2976C12.5697 11.843 11.7968 12.2947 11.1804 12.4264C10.7585 12.5157 10.2084 12.5863 8.35448 11.8244C6.1586 10.9225 4.68671 8.8062 4.38733 8.37575C4.36349 8.34148 4.34708 8.31789 4.33834 8.30646C4.33501 8.30191 4.33105 8.29654 4.3265 8.29037C4.17586 8.08609 3.38061 7.00762 3.38061 5.89364C3.38061 4.77821 3.93608 4.21827 4.18485 3.96751C4.19202 3.96028 4.19895 3.9533 4.20559 3.94658C4.40003 3.74907 4.7224 3.65974 5.03071 3.65974C5.12089 3.66018 5.21103 3.66328 5.30102 3.66903Z" fill="white"></path> </svg> </span> WhatsApp </a> </li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="contact-form-block"> <div class="form-wrapper"> <h2 class="contact-form-title">Ready to chat?</h2> <p class="contact-form-subtitle">Reach out to receive a free consultation and entrust your IT initiative to a company that will help you manifest your vision and business approach into an ever-growing and adaptable business.</p> <div class="contact-form"> <div class="wpcf7 no-js" id="wpcf7-f59516-o1" lang="en-US" dir="ltr" data-wpcf7-id="59516"> <div class="screen-reader-response"><p role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p> <ul></ul></div> <form action="/#wpcf7-f59516-o1" method="post" class="wpcf7-form init" aria-label="Contact form" enctype="multipart/form-data" novalidate="novalidate" data-status="init"> <fieldset class="hidden-fields-container"><input type="hidden" name="_wpcf7" value="59516" /><input type="hidden" name="_wpcf7_version" value="6.1.7" /><input type="hidden" name="_wpcf7_locale" value="en_US" /><input type="hidden" name="_wpcf7_unit_tag" value="wpcf7-f59516-o1" /><input type="hidden" name="_wpcf7_container_post" value="0" /><input type="hidden" name="_wpcf7_posted_data_hash" value="" /><input type="hidden" name="_wpcf7_recaptcha_response" value="" /> </fieldset> <div class="visible-input-wrapper"> <span class="wpcf7-form-control-wrap" data-name="your_name"><input size="40" maxlength="400" class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text form__control" id="form_footer_input_name" aria-invalid="false" placeholder="." value="" type="text" name="your_name" /></span> <label for="form_footer_input_name" class="form-label">Your Name</label> </div> <input class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden" value="" type="hidden" name="client_id" /> <div class="visible-input-wrapper visible-input-wrapper-email"> <span class="wpcf7-form-control-wrap" data-name="EMAIL"><input size="40" maxlength="400" class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-email wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-email form__control" id="form_footer_input_email" aria-required="true" aria-invalid="false" placeholder="." value="" type="email" name="EMAIL" /></span> <label for="form_footer_input_email" class="form-label">Email*</label> <div class="icon-wrapper"> <img alt="icon" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/source/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/themes/elogic/resources/images/svg/error_icon.svg" class="nitro-lazy" decoding="async" nitro-lazy-empty id="MzA2NDo4NA==-1" data-nitro-empty-id="MzA2NDo4NA==-1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMzIgMzIiIHdpZHRoPSIzMiIgaGVpZ2h0PSIzMiIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj48L3N2Zz4=" /> </div> </div> <div class="visible-input-wrapper"> <span class="wpcf7-form-control-wrap" data-name="your_text"><textarea cols="10" rows="3" maxlength="2000" class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-textarea form__control" id="form_footer_input_text" aria-invalid="false" placeholder="." name="your_text"></textarea></span> <label for="form_footer_input_text" class="form-label">How can we help?</label> </div> <div class="button-wrapper"> <div class="form__file"> <a class="form__file btn-upload"> <span class="btn-upload__text">Attach file</span><i class="btn-upload__icon"></i></a> <span class="wpcf7-form-control-wrap" data-name="your_file"><input size="40" class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-file" accept=".png,.jpg,.jpeg,.pdf,.doc,.docx" aria-invalid="false" type="file" name="your_file" /></span> </div> <div class="form__bts"> <button type="submit" onsubmit="return false" class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-submit btn btn-arr btn-blue btn-submit btn-arrow-right">Send message</button> </div> </div> <input class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden" value="" type="hidden" name="gaCampaign" /> <input class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden" value="" type="hidden" name="gaReferer" /> <input class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden" value="" type="hidden" name="gaEntrancePoint" /> <input class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden" value="" type="hidden" name="gaFirstEntrancePoint" /> <input class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden" value="" type="hidden" name="sourcePageURL" /> <input class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden" value="" type="hidden" name="id_client" /> <input class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden" value="" type="hidden" name="session_number" /> <input class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden" value="" type="hidden" name="time_stamp" /> <input class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden" value="Test hubspot timestamp" type="hidden" name="timestamp" /> <input class="wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden" value="23399a45-e804-486d-bc9c-a69302b53ceb" type="hidden" name="formId" /><div class="wpcf7-response-output" aria-hidden="true"></div> </form> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="seo-section"> <div class="container"> <h2 class="p1">About Elogic Commerce</h2> <p class="p1">Elogic Commerce is an ecommerce development company founded in <span data-sheets-root="1">2009</span>, headquartered in Tallinn, Estonia, with offices in <span data-sheets-root="1">Prague, Munich, Dresden, Amsterdam, Stockholm, London, New York</span>. With <span data-sheets-root="1">200</span>+ commerce engineers, UI/UX designers, CRO specialists, and project managers, Elogic Commerce specializes in complex B2B and B2B2C ecommerce development, B2B and B2C marketplace development, enterprise replatforming, ERP/CRM/PIM integration, multi-country global rollouts, and long-term managed support.</p> <p class="p1">Elogic Commerce works across Adobe Commerce (Magento), <a href="https://elogic.co/blog/the-guide-to-shopify-plus-benefits-and-core-features/">Shopify Plus</a>, BigCommerce, Salesforce Commerce Cloud, and composable architectures including commercetools. The company holds an NPS of <span data-sheets-root="1">70</span>, a Clutch rating of <span data-sheets-root="1">5.0</span>, and is a certified <span data-sheets-root="1">Adobe Commerce Silver Solution Partner</span>, <span data-sheets-root="1">Shopify Plus Partner</span>, Certified Bigcommerce Partner, <span data-sheets-root="1">Salesforce Select Partner</span>, and <span data-sheets-root="1">Hyvä Bronze Partner</span>. Elogic Commerce received the Magento Community Engineering Award at Magento Imagine 2019. The company holds <span data-sheets-root="1">ISO 27001 · SOC 2 Type II · ISO 9001</span> certifications.</p> <p class="p1">Core competencies: ERP-led integrations (SAP S/4HANA, NetSuite, Microsoft Dynamics 365, Visma, Acumatica, Infor, Epicor, Odoo), B2B self-service portals, vendor portals, dealer portals, and B2B customer portal development, account-specific pricing and B2B workflow engineering, B2B and B2C marketplace development, multi-country global commerce rollouts, phased replatforming, technical audit and rescue, performance engineering, Hyvä theme development, commerce UX and CRO, and governed delivery with structured discovery, milestone accountability, and transparent change management. Industry experience includes chemical and pharmaceutical manufacturers, building materials and packaging companies, industrial machinery and equipment, automotive parts, electrical and lighting manufacturers, medical devices, FMCG and food production, consumer electronics, jewelry and luxury goods, and fashion and apparel. Typical project investments range from $<span data-sheets-root="1">25,000</span> to $<span data-sheets-root="1">500,000</span>+. Delivery is managed from offices in New York, London, Stockholm, Dresden, and Prague, with project management optimized for US and Western European time zones.</p> <h2>Ecommerce development services we deliver</h2> <p>Elogic Commerce delivers&nbsp;<a href="/services/">ecommerce development services</a>&nbsp;for mid-market and enterprise teams across Adobe Commerce (Magento), Shopify Plus, BigCommerce, Salesforce Commerce Cloud and commercetools. Our work spans&nbsp;<a href="https://elogic.co/services/b2b-ecommerce-development-and-consulting/">B2B and B2B2C commerce development</a>,&nbsp;<a href="/services/replatforming/">enterprise replatforming and migration</a>,&nbsp;<a href="/integrations/">ERP / CRM / PIM integration</a>, B2B self-service and dealer portals,&nbsp;<a href="/services/marketplace-development-services/">marketplace development</a>,&nbsp;<a href="/services/hyva-themes-development/">Hyvä theme development</a>, performance optimization, and long-term managed support. We are typically the strongest fit when platform choice, integrations, and delivery quality have a material impact on revenue — and we tell you when we are not the right fit. Explore our ecommerce development services, see how we approach B2B ecommerce development, or book a discovery call for an honest assessment of fit, scope, and timeline.</p> </div> </section> </main> <script nitro-exclude>
